a)</h4>
For part (a):
<ol id="fs-id1167794011770" type="a">
<li>Identify the knowns: <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.990</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9.11</mn><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−31</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>kg.</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.990</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9.11</mn><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−31</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>kg.</mtext></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></li>
<li>Identify the unknown: <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mtext>class</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mtext>class</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></li>
<li>Express the answer as an equation: <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mtext>rel</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mtext>rel</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> with <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>/</mtext><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>/</mtext><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></li>
<li>Do the calculation. First calculate <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> Keep extra digits because this is an intermediate calculation:
<div data-type="equation" id="fs-id1167793964778" class="unnumbered" data-label=""><math display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right"><mi>γ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0.990</mn><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mn>7.0888</mn><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right"><mi>γ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0.990</mn><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd columnalign="left"><mo>=</mo><mn>7.0888</mn><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></annotation-xml></semantics></math></div>
